  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, equation is:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Put&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>, then we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>320</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6825</mn></math></p>"
